<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

  <meta name="description" content="Welcome to SAMMARTHA Group of Companies, connecting departments, businesses and opportunities.">

  <meta name="theme-color" content="#172719">

  <title>SAMMATHA GROUP | Official Website</title>

  <style>
    :root {
      --green: #567b27;
      --dark-green: #263c1c;
      --light-green: #edf3e5;
      --gold: #c7a85b;
      --dark: #17211b;
      --white: #ffffff;
      --grey: #687368;
      --background: #f8faf6;
    }

    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
    }

    body {
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
      color: var(--dark);
      background: var(--background);
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    a {
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    img {
      max-width: 100%;
    }

    .container {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 1250px;
      margin: auto;
    }

    /* HEADER */

    header {
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 1000;
      background: white;
      box-shadow: 0 3px 20px #0000000c;
    }

    .header-inner {
      max-width: 1400px;
      margin: auto;
      padding: 14px 5%;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .brand {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 13px;
      color: var(--dark-green);
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .company-logo {
      width: 76px;
      height: 76px;
      object-fit: contain;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: white;
      border: 1px solid #e4e8dd;
    }

    .brand-name {
      display: block;
      font-size: 25px;
      font-weight: 900;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      line-height: 1.3;
    }

    .brand-subtitle {
      display: block;
      color: var(--green);
      font-size: 10px;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    nav {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 20px;
    }

    nav a {
      color: #344033;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: bold;
      transition: color 0.2s;
    }

    nav a:hover {
      color: var(--green);
    }

    .nav-contact {
      padding: 10px 17px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      color: white;
      background: var(--green);
    }

    .nav-contact:hover {
      color: white;
      background: var(--dark-green);
    }

    /* HERO SECTION */

    .hero {
      min-height: 610px;
      padding: 100px 7%;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      color: white;
      background:
        radial-gradient(
          circle at 85% 20%,
          #78974d 0,
          transparent 28%
        ),
        linear-gradient(
          120deg,
          #172719,
          #304c25 55%,
          #567b27
        );
    }

    .hero-content {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 1050px;
      margin: auto;
    }

    .hero-label {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 8px 16px;
      border: 1px solid #ffffff65;
      border-radius: 30px;
      margin-bottom: 25px;
      color: #e7f0dc;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: bold;
      letter-spacing: 3px;
    }

    .hero h1 {
      max-width: 900px;
      font-size: clamp(40px, 7vw, 78px);
      line-height: 1.08;
      margin-bottom: 25px;
    }

    .hero h1 span {
      color: #d9c27f;
    }

    .hero p {
      max-width: 700px;
      margin-bottom: 32px;
      color: #e2e9dc;
      font-size: 17px;
    }

    .button {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 13px 23px;
      margin: 4px 8px 4px 0;
      border: 1px solid transparent;
      border-radius: 6px;
      background: var(--green);
      color: white;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: bold;
      transition: 0.2s;
    }

    .button:hover {
      background: var(--dark-green);
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }

    .button-white {
      color: var(--dark-green);
      background: white;
    }

    .button-white:hover {
      color: var(--dark-green);
      background: #edf3e5;
    }

    .button-outline {
      color: white;
      background: transparent;
      border-color: #ffffff80;
    }

    .button-outline:hover {
      color: white;
      background: #ffffff18;
    }

    /* GENERAL SECTIONS */

    section {
      padding: 85px 7%;
      scroll-margin-top: 115px;
    }

    .section-heading {
      max-width: 780px;
      margin: 0 auto 45px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      color: var(--green);
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: bold;
      letter-spacing: 3px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    h2 {
      margin: 12px 0 20px;
      font-size: clamp(30px, 4vw, 43px);
      line-height: 1.2;
    }

    .section-heading p {
      color: var(--grey);
    }

    /* ABOUT US */

    #about {
      background: white;
    }

    .about-grid {
      max-width: 1150px;
      margin: auto;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 50px;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .about-copy p {
      color: var(--grey);
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    .about-copy h2 {
      max-width: 600px;
    }

    .about-image {
      min-height: 340px;
      padding: 35px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;
      border-radius: 18px;
      color: white;
      background:
        radial-gradient(
          circle at top right,
          #7e9e50,
          transparent 45%
        ),
        linear-gradient(140deg, #172719, #3b5a2b);
    }

    .about-image .big-letter {
      color: #d9c27f;
      font-size: 100px;
      font-weight: 900;
      line-height: 1;
    }

    .about-image h3 {
      margin: 15px 0;
      font-size: 27px;
    }

    .about-image p {
      color: #e1e8d9;
    }

    /* COMPANY FACTS */

    .highlights {
      padding: 35px 7%;
      background: var(--light-green);
    }

    .highlight-grid {
      max-width: 1050px;
      margin: auto;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 25px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .highlight h3 {
      color: var(--dark-green);
      font-size: 21px;
    }

    .highlight p {
      color: var(--grey);
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    /* DEPARTMENTS */

    #departments {
      background: var(--background);
    }

    .department-grid {
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: auto;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 23px;
    }

    .department-card {
      padding: 29px;
      border: 1px solid #e4e9df;
      border-radius: 13px;
      background: white;
      transition: 0.25s;
    }

    .department-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-5px);
      border-color: #a8bd8a;
      box-shadow: 0 15px 35px #263c1c0d;
    }

    .department-number {
      color: var(--green);
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: bold;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
    }

    .department-icon {
      width: 58px;
      height: 58px;
      margin: 18px 0;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      border-radius: 12px;
      background: var(--light-green);
      font-size: 29px;
    }

    .department-card h3 {
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      font-size: 20px;
    }

    .department-card p {
      color: var(--grey);
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .department-link {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 17px;
      color: var(--green);
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    /* MISSION */

    #mission {
      color: white;
      background: var(--dark-green);
    }

    .mission-content {
      max-width: 850px;
      margin: auto;
      text-align: center;
    }

    #mission .eyebrow {
      color: #d9c27f;
    }

    #mission p {
      color: #e0e9d9;
    }

    /* VISION AND VALUES */

    #vision {
      background: white;
    }

    .vision-content {
      max-width: 850px;
      margin: auto;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .values-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 22px;
      margin-top: 40px;
      text-align: left;
    }

    .value-card {
      padding: 25px;
      border: 1px solid #e4e9df;
      border-radius: 12px;
      background: #fbfcf9;
    }

    .value-card h3 {
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      color: var(--dark-green);
    }

    .value-card p {
      color: var(--grey);
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    /* CONTACT */

    #contact {
      background: var(--light-green);
    }

    .contact-card {
      max-width: 800px;
      margin: auto;
      padding: 45px 30px;
      border-radius: 16px;
      background: white;
      text-align: center;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 35px #263c1c08;
    }

    .contact-card p {
      max-width: 620px;
      margin: 0 auto 20px;
      color: var(--grey);
    }

    .contact-note {
      margin-top: 15px;
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    /* FOOTER */

    footer {
      padding: 45px 7% 20px;
      color: #dce5d7;
      background: #142016;
    }

    .footer-inner {
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: auto;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 35px;
    }

    .footer-brand {
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      color: white;
      font-size: 22px;
      font-weight: 900;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
    }

    footer h3 {
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      color: white;
      font-size: 15px;
    }

    footer p,
    footer a {
      color: #bdcbb7;
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    .footer-links {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    footer a:hover {
      color: white;
    }

    .copyright {
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 35px auto 0;
      padding-top: 18px;
      border-top: 1px solid #ffffff20;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    /* MOBILE RESPONSIVE DESIGN */

    @media (max-width: 950px) {
      .header-inner {
        flex-direction: column;
      }

      .department-grid {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      }

      .about-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      .header-inner {
        padding: 12px 4%;
      }

      .company-logo {
        width: 60px;
        height: 60px;
      }

      .brand-name {
        font-size: 21px;
      }

      .brand-subtitle {
        font-size: 9px;
        letter-spacing: 1px;
      }

      nav {
        gap: 12px;
      }

      nav a {
        font-size: 12px;
      }

      .hero {
        min-height: 520px;
        padding: 70px 6%;
      }

      .hero p {
        font-size: 15px;
      }

      section {
        padding: 60px 6%;
      }

      .department-grid,
      .values-grid,
      .highlight-grid,
      .footer-inner {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .about-image {
        min-height: 280px;
      }

      .contact-card {
        padding: 32px 20px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <!-- HEADER: IMAGE LOGO AND TEXT LOGO -->

  <header>
    <div class="header-inner">

      <a class="brand" href="#home">
        <img
          src="sammarth-logo.jpg"
          alt="SAMMARTH Trading and Projects logo"
          class="company-logo"
        >

        <span>
          <span class="brand-name">SAMMATHA</span>
          <span class="brand-subtitle">GROUP OF COMPANIES</span>
        </span>
      </a>

      <nav>
        <a href="#home">Home</a>
        <a href="#about">About Us</a>
        <a href="#departments">Departments</a>
        <a href="#mission">Our Mission</a>
        <a href="#vision">Our Vision</a>
        <a href="#contact" class="nav-contact">Contact Us</a>
      </nav>

    </div>
  </header>

  <main>

    <!-- HOMEPAGE -->

    <section class="hero" id="home">
      <div class="hero-content">

        <span class="hero-label">
          SAMMATHA GROUP OF COMPANIES
        </span>

        <h1>
          One Group.<br>
          Multiple Opportunities.<br>
          <span>One Vision.</span>
        </h1>

        <p>
          Welcome to SAMMATHA Group of Companies, a group
          bringing different departments and business
          opportunities together under one shared vision.
          We believe in innovation, collaboration and building
          a foundation for future growth.
        </p>

        <div>
          <a href="#departments" class="button button-white">
            Explore Departments
          </a>

          <a href="#about" class="button button-outline">
            Learn About Us
          </a>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ABOUT US -->

    <section id="about">
      <div class="container about-grid">

        <div class="about-copy">
          <div class="eyebrow">Who We Are</div>

          <h2>
            Introducing SAMMATHA Group of Companies
          </h2>

          <p>
            SAMMATHA is a group of companies consisting of
            different departments. The group brings these
            areas together under one identity while allowing
            each department to focus on its own activities
            and objectives.
          </p>

          <p>
            Our aim is to establish a strong organisation
            built around professionalism, collaboration,
            creativity and responsible business development.
          </p>

          <p>
            As the group grows, this website will introduce
            our departments, showcase our projects and provide
            a central place to learn about SAMMATHA.
          </p>

          <a href="#departments" class="button">
            Meet Our Departments
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="about-image">
          <div class="big-letter">S</div>

          <h3>One Identity. Many Possibilities.</h3>

          <p>
            Bringing ideas, people and business activities
            together to build a shared future.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- GROUP HIGHLIGHTS -->

    <div class="highlights">
      <div class="highlight-grid">

        <div class="highlight">
          <h3>One Group</h3>
          <p>United under the SAMMATHA name.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="highlight">
          <h3>Multiple Departments</h3>
          <p>Different areas working towards shared goals.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="highlight">
          <h3>One Vision</h3>
          <p>Building opportunities for the future.</p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- DEPARTMENTS -->

    <section id="departments">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <div class="eyebrow">Our Organisation</div>

        <h2>Explore Our Departments</h2>

        <p>
          Each department represents a potential area of
          activity within the SAMMATHA Group. Select the
          areas that match your actual business structure.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="department-grid">

        <article class="department-card">
          <div class="department-number">DEPARTMENT 01</div>
          <div class="department-icon">💻</div>

          <h3>Technology & Innovation</h3>

          <p>
            Technology development, digital solutions,
            innovation and new ideas for the future.
          </p>

          <a class="department-link" href="#contact">
            Enquire About This Department →
          </a>
        </article>

        <article class="department-card">
          <div class="department-number">DEPARTMENT 02</div>
          <div class="department-icon">📈</div>

          <h3>Business Development</h3>

          <p>
            Business opportunities, strategic planning,
            partnerships and organisational growth.
          </p>

          <a class="department-link" href="#contact">
            Enquire About This Department →
          </a>
        </article>

        <article class="department-card">
          <div class="department-number">DEPARTMENT 03</div>
          <div class="department-icon">🎬</div>

          <h3>Media & Entertainment</h3>

          <p>
            Media production, creative content,
            entertainment and digital communication.
          </p>

          <a class="department-link" href="#contact">
            Enquire About This Department →
          </a>
        </article>

        <article class="department-card">
          <div class="department-number">DEPARTMENT 04</div>
          <div class="department-icon">🚚</div>

          <h3>Transport & Logistics</h3>

          <p>
            Transport services, logistics planning
            and opportunities in the movement of goods.
          </p>

          <a class="department-link" href="#contact">
            Enquire About This Department →
          </a>
        </article>

        <article class="department-card">
          <div class="department-number">DEPARTMENT 05</div>
          <div class="department-icon">🏗️</div>

          <h3>Construction & Projects</h3>

          <p>
            Project development, construction activities
            and infrastructure-related opportunities.
          </p>

          <a class="department-link" href="#contact">
            Enquire About This Department →
          </a>
        </article>

        <article class="department-card">
          <div class="department-number">DEPARTMENT 06</div>
          <div class="department-icon">🌱</div>

          <h3>Trading & Agriculture</h3>

          <p>
            Potential trading activities, agricultural
            opportunities and commercial development.
          </p>

          <a class="department-link" href="#contact">
            Enquire About This Department →
          </a>
        </article>

      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- MISSION -->

    <section id="mission">
      <div class="mission-content">

        <div class="eyebrow">Our Mission</div>

        <h2>Moving Forward With Purpose</h2>

        <p>
          Our mission is to develop a connected group of
          companies where departments can pursue their
          objectives while contributing to the wider goals
          of SAMMATHA. We aim to encourage teamwork,
          professional standards, innovation and
          opportunities for sustainable growth.
        </p>

        <a href="#vision" class="button button-white">
          Discover Our Vision
        </a>

      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- VISION AND VALUES -->

    <section id="vision">
      <div class="vision-content">

        <div class="eyebrow">Our Vision</div>

        <h2>Building A Stronger Future Together</h2>

        <p>
          Our vision is to establish SAMMATHA as a respected
          group of companies with a clear identity, effective
          departments and a commitment to creating meaningful
          business opportunities.
        </p>

        <div class="values-grid">

          <div class="value-card">
            <h3>Integrity</h3>

            <p>
              We value honesty, accountability and
              responsible business practices.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="value-card">
            <h3>Innovation</h3>

            <p>
              We welcome creative thinking and new
              approaches to business challenges.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="value-card">
            <h3>Collaboration</h3>

            <p>
              We believe departments can achieve more
              by working towards shared objectives.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="value-card">
            <h3>Professionalism</h3>

            <p>
              We aim to build trust through quality,
              communication and responsibility.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="value-card">
            <h3>Growth</h3>
